name: ap_approval_graph
description: "AUDIT 1 - The approval graph: approvers linked to the vendors whose invoices they approved (one link per invoice, TS and AMOUNT on the links). Run Articulation points and Bridges (E-07 and V-041 are the only cut vertices at a vendor with more than one approver), k-core (E-07, E-08 and E-09 form the densest core with their 20 vendors), Betweenness (the utilities vendor V-001 and the CFO E-01 lead: busy, not guilty) and Is forest (false here, true on the org chart in ap_org_links_dataset)."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
profile: finance
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: ap_approval_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[2]: ts,amount
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
